{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":795072,"ns":0,"title":"Binder clip","extract":"A binder clip (also known as a foldback clip, paper clamp, banker's clip, foldover clip, bobby clip, bulldog clip or clasp) is a simple device for binding sheets of paper together.  It leaves the paper intact and can be removed quickly and easily, unlike the staple.","description":"Device for binding sheets of paper together","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}